      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Wilmar flourished as a timber hub in the 20th century, with the Gates Lumber Company and the Wilmar and Saline Valley Railroad transporting pine lumber until the 1920s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
