      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/wilmar_arkansas",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A turbine pump on a natural gas pipeline, operational since 1948, now part of CenterPoint Energy, followed a 1928 pipeline project by the Arkansas-Louisiana Gas Company.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
